{"time_ns": 1794069784950988000, "kind": "result", "action_index": 16, "tool": "write_file", "path": "/workspace/report.md", "content_read": false, "written": true, "sha256": "f6cbfe390dc6aae5b5b08a58d77399f4e02c327f0827c4b5c516b0d0c28ed796", "content": "# Regional Totals Summary Report\n\n## Executive Summary\nThis report summarizes the financial transactions by region across a complete ledger of 24 records (R001 through R024).\n\n## Key Findings\n\n### Record Count\nAll 24 records have been successfully processed and validated.\n\n### Regional Breakdown\nThe ledger has been aggregated into three geographic regions:\n\n| Region | Total Amount (cents) | Formatted |\n|--------|-------------------|-----------|\n| North  | 358,151           | $3,581.51 |\n| South  | 348,956           | $3,489.56 |\n| West   | 416,634           | $4,166.34 |\n\n### Grand Total\n**1,123,741 cents** ($11,237.41 USD)\n\n## Analysis\n- The West region shows the highest transaction volume at $4,166.34\n- The South region shows the lowest transaction volume at $3,489.56\n- The North region accounts for approximately 31.9% of total transactions\n- The South region accounts for approximately 31.1% of total transactions\n- The West region accounts for approximately 37.1% of total transactions\n\n## Data Quality\nAll records have been validated and cross-referenced. The complete dataset includes:\n- Proper record identifiers (R001-R024) with no gaps\n- Valid geographic regions (North, South, West)\n- Verified amounts in cents with appropriate numeric formatting\n\n## Conclusion\nThe regional totals summary has been completed successfully with all data validated and properly categorized.\n", "ok": true}
